#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-drag_teleop.md:1 c419d834bd7a479282e68ed67a1d5574
msgid "Drag teaching is not implemented"
msgstr "拖动示教未实现"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-drag_teleop.md:3 b53eccf1c0ca4e02901ac554a3f8862c
msgid ""
"This stack does **not** implement drag teaching (拖动遥操作): no physical drag-"
"to-teach path, no trajectory record/playback, and no `enter_teach_mode` API."
msgstr ""
"本技术栈 **没有** 实现拖动示教（拖动遥操作）：没有物理拖动示教路径、没有轨迹录制/回放，也没有 `enter_teach_mode` API。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/7-drag_teleop.md:5 6eb09d2b8581446f80a38542c2faf84a
msgid ""
"**Implemented** teleop for HT Panthera is master–slave **isomorphic teleop**"
" (同构遥操作). The package is still named "
"[`drag_teleop_controller`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller); follow [Isomorphic "
"Teleop](7-isomorphic_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"HT Panthera **已实现** 的遥操作是主从 **同构遥操作**。软件包仍名为 "
"[`drag_teleop_controller`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller)；请按 [同构遥操作](7-isomorphic_teleop.md) 操作。"
